  {
   "address": 1822,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Sixteen replacement values indexed by the current low-nibble cell in OPEN DOOR. The checked cell1 maps to7; this is a local map mutation, not a traversal or save-persistence proof."
  },
  {
   "address": 1838,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "CLOSE maps the queried cell nibble to its replacement; checked local cell7 becomes1."
  },
  {
   "address": 1854,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Sixteen low-nibble map-to-type values used by$4171. OPEN DOOR accepts type2, reports already opened for type3, and queues Nothing happens for the other types on its negative-mode path. Captured cell0 has type0, cell1 type2, and replacement7 type3."
  },
  {
   "address": 1870,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Sixteen upper column boundaries used by4115; first boundary at least2 is slot1."
  },
  {
   "address": 1902,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Sixteen selectors:0 uses bank0,1 uses0500,2 uses0501, higher values use random bits60. Live slot1 uses selector2."
  },
  {
   "address": 2015,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Scene request0 paired with entry30 at07EF; live doorway refresh retains scene6 and arrives X1952/depth6."
